      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「それなら、宣戦布告されたわよ、\n地下底国グループのご令嬢に。」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #76",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/靈夢（怒る）.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 5.254489795918367,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 76",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.254489795918367,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_076_博麗霊夢.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.077.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "713CD316-475C-4AD4-98AC-58C4E69EFBEB",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「えっ？宣戦布告ってどう言うこと。だって彼は、あんたの息子だから、彼が何も言わない限り、ここで働くんじゃないの？」",
      "characterName" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #77",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/靈夢（困る）.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 6.5863038548752835,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%88%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E5%B7%AB%E5%A5%B3",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 77",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.5863038548752835,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_077_先代の巫女.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.078.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "1A53F65A-295E-46AC-82AA-4A7A8D9194B9",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「例のご令嬢の裸を、彼が見たって言ってたわよ…」\n私は、なんだか気恥ずかしさを感じながら、そう言う。",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #78",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/靈夢（困る）.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 8.236984126984128,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 78",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.236984126984128,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_078_博麗霊夢.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.079.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "236F98B1-DD0F-426D-B8BB-4949DDF3149C",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「えっ？どういうこと、ご令嬢の裸を見たって…」",
      "characterName" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #79",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/靈夢（困る）.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 2.7230385487528346,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%88%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E5%B7%AB%E5%A5%B3",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 79",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.7230385487528346,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_079_先代の巫女.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.080.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "714A115D-B9B4-41BA-8846-F9932342E822",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「そのご令嬢と同じ部屋で過ごしていたら、ご令嬢が裸で出てきて、彼はその姿をしっかりと捉えて、ビンタを食らったって…。」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #80",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/靈夢（困る）.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 9.498231292517007,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 80",
      "voiceDuration" : 9.498231292517007,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_080_博麗霊夢.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.081.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "F2554CD2-6BDC-4E64-87BB-C23B69F316D3",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「ふーん、それであんたはどう思うのよ、\n自分の息子がご令嬢の裸を見たって言う事実に対して。」",
      "characterName" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #81",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/霊異変疑問.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 4.642267573696145,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%88%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E5%B7%AB%E5%A5%B3",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 81",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.642267573696145,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_081_先代の巫女.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.082.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "EAECBFED-5D25-4EE4-8BFC-087024EDE110",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「どうって…」私はそう言われ、意見を言おうとするが、何を言えばいいかわからない。すると、彼女がある言葉を言う。",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #82",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/霊異変疑問.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 8.780748299319727,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 82",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.780748299319727,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_082_博麗霊夢.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.083.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "A83F9882-2725-43B5-9EB4-DF949DA0A136",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「まさかとは思うけど、ヤキモチなんてしてないわよね…」\n私が、そう娘に問いただすと、娘は明らかに動揺する。",
      "characterName" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #83",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/霊異変疑問.png",
      "voiceStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "voice2StartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "duration" : 5.927278911564626,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%85%88%E4%BB%A3%E3%81%AE%E5%B7%AB%E5%A5%B3",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "backgroundName" : "BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 83",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.927278911564626,
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_083_先代の巫女.wav"
    },
    {
      "voiceCharacter" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5\/元女子校の日常　第22話_dfab8722f5.084.jpeg",
      "bgmVolume" : 0.7,
      "bgmStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "seStartTimeOffset" : 0,
      "id" : "98CA081C-D0C8-49DD-83E5-58FEE3E1B8F1",
      "seVolume" : 1,
      "telop" : "「これは、図星ね…、まぁ、いいわ。ほら、やる気出して、チャチャっと敷地内の埃を吐き出しなさい。いいわね…」",
      "characterName" : "先代の巫女",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #84",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/霊異変疑問.png",
